# Contracts

## Source of truth

| Layer | Location |
|-------|----------|
| TypeScript types | `packages/shared/src/index.ts` |
| Database | `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma` |
| REST | `docs/contracts/rest-api.md` |
| WebSocket | `docs/contracts/websocket.md` |
| Push | `docs/contracts/push-events.md` |

## Workflow

**Contract → code → docs** (never code-first without updating contracts)

1. Change `packages/shared` and/or `schema.prisma`
2. Implement in api/admin/mobile
3. Update matching `docs/contracts/*.md` in same PR

## Breaking changes

- New optional field — non-breaking
- Rename/remove enum or DTO field — update shared + all apps + docs together

## Query param convention

Public API: lowercase (`marketType=spot`, `timeframe=3M`). Map to Prisma enums in api services.

## Swagger

`/api/docs` supplements `rest-api.md`; does not replace it.
